@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Register a patient (201 Created)
# @name createPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aisha",
  "middleName": "Noor",
  "lastName": "Rahman",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-12",
  "gender": "Female",
  "maritalStatus": "Married",
  "nationalityCode": "IN",
  "identityType": "Passport",
  "identityNumber": "P1234567",
  "mobileNumber": "+919800000001",
  "email": "aisha.rahman@example.com",
  "address": {
    "line1": "12 MG Road",
    "line2": "Flat 4B",
    "city": "Bengaluru",
    "region": "Karnataka",
    "postalCode": "560001"
  },
  "occupation": "Teacher",
  "educationLevel": "Master",
  "religion": "Islam"
}

### 2. Invalid request (400 with validation errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Rahman",
  "dateOfBirth": "2099-01-01",
  "maritalStatus": "Single",
  "nationalityCode": "XX",
  "identityType": "Passport",
  "identityNumber": "P 123",
  "mobileNumber": "12345",
  "address": { "line1": "", "city": "Bengaluru" }
}

### 3. A child without a guardian (400: guardian required under 18)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Zayd",
  "lastName": "Rahman",
  "dateOfBirth": "2018-09-01",
  "gender": "Male",
  "maritalStatus": "Single",
  "nationalityCode": "IN",
  "identityType": "NationalId",
  "identityNumber": "IN-5566778899",
  "mobileNumber": "+919800000002",
  "address": { "line1": "12 MG Road", "city": "Bengaluru" }
}

### 4. The same child with a guardian (201 Created)
# @name createChild
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Zayd",
  "lastName": "Rahman",
  "dateOfBirth": "2018-09-01",
  "gender": "Male",
  "maritalStatus": "Single",
  "nationalityCode": "IN",
  "identityType": "NationalId",
  "identityNumber": "IN-5566778899",
  "mobileNumber": "+919800000002",
  "address": { "line1": "12 MG Road", "city": "Bengaluru" },
  "guardian": {
    "fullName": "Aisha Noor Rahman",
    "relationship": "Mother",
    "mobileNumber": "+919800000001"
  }
}

### 5. Same passport number again (409 Conflict from the unique index)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Someone",
  "lastName": "Else",
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-01-01",
  "gender": "Male",
  "maritalStatus": "Single",
  "nationalityCode": "GB",
  "identityType": "Passport",
  "identityNumber": "P1234567",
  "mobileNumber": "+447700900001",
  "address": { "line1": "1 High Street", "city": "London" }
}

### 6. Get the patient created in request 1 (200 OK, nationality joined from its table)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Unknown id (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. List patients
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?page=1&pageSize=10

### 9. Nationalities lookup (the codes the patient endpoints accept)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nationalities

### 10. Update the patient from request 1 (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Aisha",
  "middleName": "Noor",
  "lastName": "Rahman-Khan",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-04-12",
  "gender": "Female",
  "maritalStatus": "Married",
  "nationalityCode": "IN",
  "identityType": "Passport",
  "identityNumber": "P1234567",
  "mobileNumber": "+919800000003",
  "email": "aisha.khan@example.com",
  "address": {
    "line1": "45 Residency Road",
    "city": "Bengaluru",
    "region": "Karnataka",
    "postalCode": "560025"
  },
  "occupation": "Head Teacher",
  "educationLevel": "Master",
  "religion": "Islam"
}

### 11. Change only the mobile number (PATCH, 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.$.id}}/mobile-number
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "+919800000004"
}

### 12. Generate a file number (200 OK, e.g. CF-2026-000001)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.$.id}}/file-number

### 13. Generate again (409 Conflict: already assigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.$.id}}/file-number

### 14. Deactivate the patient (204 No Content); the header records who did it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.$.id}}/deactivate
X-Requested-By: reception.desk

### 15. List hides deactivated patients; add includeInactive=true to see them
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?includeInactive=true

### 16. Delete the child from request 4 (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/{{createChild.response.body.$.id}}

### 17. Delete an unknown id (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 18. pageSize above 100 (400 from the built-in .NET 10 validation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?page=1&pageSize=500
